{"id":"A2-L005","title":"Verb + to-infinitive: form","cefr":"A2","level":"A2","unit":"A2-U01","focus":"Verb + to-infinitive — forma","targets":{"grammar":"Verb + to-infinitive — forma","pron":"gonna e wanna (reconhecimento)","verbs":["plan"],"pv":[],"expr":["I’d like to book a room"],"words":["peak","adventure","propose","wish","reserve","local","cabin","scenery","mountain trail","solo trip","mountain hotel","three nights","travel bag","new friends","sunrise walk","booking form"],"field":"Viagens","genre":"Conto e trecho de peça","skill":"Leitura","words_min":16},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 5 · Verb + to-infinitive: form","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Verb + to-infinitive — forma.","**Verbos:** plan.","**Expressões:** I’d like to book a room.","**Pronúncia:** gonna e wanna (reconhecimento).","**16 palavras novas** (viagens).","**Texto do dia:** conto e trecho de peça."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A2):** eu consigo usar verbos seguidos de to + verbo e reservar um quarto."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você começa a praticar tarefas curtas no formato das provas.","Esta aula treina **ler textos curtos e achar informação (IELTS Reading, TOEFL Reading)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["peak","pico"],["adventure","aventura"],["propose","propor"],["wish","desejo"],["reserve","reservar"],["local","morador local"],["cabin","cabana"],["scenery","paisagem"],["mountain trail","mountain trail"],["solo trip","solo trip"],["mountain hotel","mountain hotel"],["three nights","three nights"],["travel bag","travel bag"],["new friends","new friends"],["sunrise walk","sunrise walk"],["booking form","booking form"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A short story","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"The Plan","paras":["Mia **planned to travel** alone. She **wanted to see** the mountains and **hoped to meet** new people. At the hotel she said, “**I’d like to book a room**, please.”","The clerk **offered to carry** her bag. Mia **decided to stay** three nights. She **learned to enjoy** silence."],"kicker":"SHORT STORY","by":"A reader","gloss":[["alone","sozinho"],["silence","silêncio"],["offer","oferecer"],["learn","aprender"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Mia traveled with friends.","ans":"F","why":"alone."},{"q":"Mia booked a room.","ans":"T","why":"“book a room.”"},{"q":"The clerk offered to carry her bag.","ans":"T","why":"offered to carry."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“alone” means…","opts":["sozinho","junto","longe"],"ans":0,"why":"alone."},{"q":"“offer” means…","opts":["oferecer","pedir","vender"],"ans":0,"why":"offer."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Verb + to-infinitive","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Verbo","Exemplo"],"rows":[["want","**want to see**"],["plan","**plan to travel**"],["hope","**hope to meet**"],["decide","**decide to stay**"],["offer","**offer to help**"],["learn","**learn to relax**"]],"cap":"Verb + to-infinitive"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Estes verbos pedem **to + verbo base**; não use -ing: *want to go* (não *want going*)."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"She wanted ___ the mountains. (see)","a":"to see","why":"want to."},{"s":"I plan ___ . (travel)","a":"to travel","why":"plan to."},{"s":"He offered ___ the bag. (carry)","a":"to carry","why":"offer to."},{"s":"I’d ___ to book a room. (like)","a":"like","why":"I’d like to.","say":"I’d like to book a room"}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["peak","pico"],["adventure","aventura"],["calm","calma"],["propose","propor"],["wish","desejo"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["how","many","nights","For"],"ans":"For how many nights","pt":"Por quantas noites?"},{"words":["to","book","a","room","please","I'd","like"],"ans":"I'd like to book a room please","pt":"Gostaria de reservar um quarto."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"peak","pos":"word","pt":"pico","ex":"A snowy peak.","expt":"Um pico nevado."},{"w":"adventure","pos":"word","pt":"aventura","ex":"A big adventure.","expt":"Uma grande aventura."},{"w":"propose","pos":"word","pt":"propor","ex":"He proposed a plan.","expt":"Ele propôs um plano."},{"w":"wish","pos":"word","pt":"desejo","ex":"Make a wish.","expt":"Faça um desejo."},{"w":"reserve","pos":"word","pt":"reservar","ex":"Reserve a room.","expt":"Reserve um quarto."},{"w":"local","pos":"word","pt":"morador local","ex":"Ask a local.","expt":"Pergunte a um morador local."},{"w":"cabin","pos":"word","pt":"cabana","ex":"A wooden cabin.","expt":"Uma cabana de madeira."},{"w":"scenery","pos":"word","pt":"paisagem","ex":"Beautiful scenery.","expt":"Paisagem linda."},{"w":"mountain trail","pos":"word","pt":"mountain trail","ex":"trilha de montanha","expt":"A mountain trail."},{"w":"solo trip","pos":"word","pt":"solo trip","ex":"viagem sozinho","expt":"A solo trip."},{"w":"mountain hotel","pos":"word","pt":"mountain hotel","ex":"hotel de montanha","expt":"A mountain hotel."},{"w":"three nights","pos":"word","pt":"three nights","ex":"três noites","expt":"Three nights."},{"w":"travel bag","pos":"word","pt":"travel bag","ex":"bolsa de viagem","expt":"A travel bag."},{"w":"new friends","pos":"word","pt":"new friends","ex":"novos amigos","expt":"New friends."},{"w":"sunrise walk","pos":"word","pt":"sunrise walk","ex":"caminhada ao nascer do sol","expt":"A sunrise walk."},{"w":"booking form","pos":"word","pt":"booking form","ex":"formulário de reserva","expt":"A booking form."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**I’d like to book a room** — Gostaria de reservar um quarto","**I’d like to book a room, please.** — Gostaria de reservar um quarto.","**For how many nights?** — Por quantas noites?","**Three. I plan to stay until Friday.** — Três. Pretendo ficar até sexta.","**It won’t hurt.** — Não vai doer.","**Make an appointment.** — Marque uma consulta.","**Can I reschedule?** — Posso remarcar?"]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"plan","pt":"planejar","forms":[["I / you / we / they plan","I plan a trip."],["he / she / it plans","She plans a party."]]}]},{"type":"table","head":["Phrasal verb","Significado","Exemplo"],"rows":[["**look forward to**","aguardar com ansiedade","I look forward to it. — Aguardo ansiosamente."]],"cap":"Phrasal verbs"}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Booking a room","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Booking a room","lines":[["Mia","I’d like to book a room, please.","Gostaria de reservar um quarto."],["Clerk","For how many nights?","Por quantas noites?"],["Mia","Three. I plan to stay until Friday.","Três. Pretendo ficar até sexta."],["Clerk","Perfect. I’ll offer you a room with a view.","Perfeito. Ofereço um quarto com vista."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: gonna e wanna (reconhecimento)","items":[{"label":"gonna e wanna (reconhecimento)","note":"Na fala: going to → gonna, want to → wanna. Reconheça; na escrita use a forma completa.","words":["I’m gonna go","I wanna eat","What are you gonna do?"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say what you plan to do.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I plan to travel next year."},{"q":"Say what you want to see.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I want to see the mountains."},{"q":"Book a room.","pt":"Reserve.","model":"I’d like to book a room, please."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with verb + to.","model":"I want to travel. I plan to visit Lisbon. I hope to meet new people. I decided to learn English. I’d like to book a room.","checklist":["Usei **to + verbo**","Usei **I’d like to**","Frases claras"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “peak” mean?","opts":["pico","aventura","propor"],"ans":0,"why":"**peak** = pico."},{"q":"What does “adventure” mean?","opts":["calma","aventura","desejo"],"ans":1,"why":"**adventure** = aventura."},{"q":"What does “calm” mean?","opts":["propor","reservar","calma"],"ans":2,"why":"**calm** = calma."},{"q":"What does “propose” mean?","opts":["propor","desejo","jornada"],"ans":0,"why":"**propose** = propor."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}